---
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>kx system — hub</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin="">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500;1,600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Reenie+Beanie&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #FCFAF5;
            --ink: #23211d;
            --ink-soft: #55503f;
            --line: #ddd4bf;
            --teal: #2A4747;
            --gold: #B08D57;
            --seal: #8B2626;
            --panel: #F5F1E6;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            background-color: var(--bg);
            background-image:
                url("https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/natural-paper.png"),
                url("https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/natural-paper.png");
            background-position: 0px 0px, 40px 60px;
            background-repeat: repeat;
            color: var(--ink);
            font-family: "EB Garamond", serif;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .kx-topbar {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 1.1rem 2rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        }
        .kx-brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: baseline;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-family: "Reenie Beanie", cursive;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            color: var(--ink);
        }
        .kx-brand small {
            font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.62rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.16em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--ink-soft);
        }
        .kx-crumbs {
            font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .kx-crumbs a { color: var(--ink-soft); text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
        .kx-crumbs a:hover { color: var(--teal); border-color: var(--teal); }

        .hero {
            max-width: 780px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 4.5rem 1.75rem 2.5rem;
        }
        .hero .kicker {
            font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.22em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--gold);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 3.6rem);
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 1.05;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
            margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
        }
        .hero h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--teal); }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: var(--ink-soft);
            max-width: 62ch;
        }

        .grid {
            max-width: 780px;
            margin: 1rem auto 0;
            padding: 0 1.75rem 6rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .module-card {
            display: block;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--ink);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            background: var(--panel);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
            transition: border-color 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
        }
        .module-card.is-stub {
            opacity: 0.55;
            cursor: default;
        }

        .module-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.2rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            padding-top: 0.9rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        }
        .module-links a {
            font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--teal);
            border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
        }
        .module-links a:hover { border-color: var(--teal); }
        .module-links a:first-child { color: var(--gold); }
        .module-links a:first-child:hover { border-color: var(--gold); }

        .dash-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        @media (max-width: 760px) { .dash-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
        @media (max-width: 560px) { .dash-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
        .dash-card {
            display: block; text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink);
            background: var(--ink); background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2A2722, #1c1a17);
            border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.4rem 1.6rem;
            transition: transform 0.25s ease;
        }
        .dash-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }
        .dash-kicker {
            font-family: "Inter", sans-serif; font-size: 0.64rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em;
            text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .dash-card h3 { font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 0.4rem; color: #FCFAF5; }
        .dash-card p { font-family: "Inter", sans-serif; font-size: 0.82rem; color: #d9d3c4; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }

        .module-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: baseline;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
        }
        .module-id {
            font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            color: var(--gold);
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }
        .module-status {
            font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.66rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--ink-soft);
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .module-title {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
        }
        .module-desc {
            font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--ink-soft);
            margin: 0;
        }

        .section-label {
            font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.68rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.16em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--ink-soft);
            margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem;
            padding-top: 1.5rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        }
        .grid > .section-label:first-child { border-top: none; padding-top: 0; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="kx-topbar">
        <a href="/astro-project-v2/kx/" class="kx-brand">& <small>kx system</small></a>
        <nav class="kx-crumbs">
            <a href="/astro-project-v2/">interlynkx</a> / kx
        </nav>
    </div>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="kicker">back end</div>
        <h1>ground up <em>kx</em> system</h1>
        <p>
            El andamiaje detrás de interlynkx: cómo está construido el sistema que produce todo
            lo demás en esta página. Sesiones de pensamiento, arquitectura de contexto, skills,
            flujos. Este hub crece a medida que se van diseñando y documentando los módulos.
        </p>
    </section>

    <div class="grid">
        <div class="section-label">dashboard</div>
        <div class="dash-row">
            <a class="dash-card" href="/astro-project-v2/kx/sistema/">
                <span class="dash-kicker">estado actual + visión</span>
                <h3>Sistema</h3>
                <p>Módulos y piezas: qué existe, en qué estado, qué es todavía solo idea.</p>
            </a>
            <a class="dash-card" href="/astro-project-v2/kx/tareas/">
                <span class="dash-kicker">backlog</span>
                <h3>Tareas</h3>
                <p>Qué queda, agrupado por quién lo puede desbloquear.</p>
            </a>
            <a class="dash-card" href="/astro-project-v2/kx/anatomia/">
                <span class="dash-kicker">por tipo de objeto</span>
                <h3>Anatomía</h3>
                <p>Módulos, skills, templates, stack, integraciones — todo cortado horizontal, actual vs. proyectado.</p>
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="section-label">00 · núcleo — contexto e infraestructura</div>

        <div class="module-card">
            <div class="module-row">
                <span class="module-id">00 · módulo base</span>
                <span class="module-status">propuesta v1</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="module-title">Análisis sistémico y planes de acción</h3>
            <p class="module-desc">
                Diagnóstico completo del módulo de contexto e infraestructura: stocks y flujos,
                bucles de realimentación, la arquitectura del Núcleo, y dieciocho planes de
                acción concretos, uno por idea, con software, fases y criterios de éxito.
            </p>
            <div class="module-links">
                <a href="/astro-project-v2/kx/modulo-base-mapa/">mapa visual</a>
                <a href="/astro-project-v2/kx/modulo-base/">análisis completo</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-label">próximos módulos</div>

        <div class="module-card is-stub">
            <div class="module-row">
                <span class="module-id">01 · sesiones</span>
                <span class="module-status">sin documentar</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="module-title">Sesiones de pensamiento sistémico</h3>
            <p class="module-desc">Pipeline de destilación: de sesión dictada a contexto, pendientes y specs.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="module-card is-stub">
            <div class="module-row">
                <span class="module-id">02 · skills</span>
                <span class="module-status">sin documentar</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="module-title">Wiki de skills y flujos</h3>
            <p class="module-desc">Catálogo vivo de todo lo que el sistema sabe ejecutar.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
